{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 927,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c12e2ae955af60f9f777b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ef1367ad379297b65b5a3f95305740333f9fee9200162f51b5c7bd1d1f05d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93d879ceb27b2c35b35e8a09",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时速度提升\\n若为东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则一段时间内大幅提升\\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1313d8357eda1bb11ab3db53de686c8f1cf18fb574d77d4b5b75744cf61f40b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100101311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebb7b94ac26ea6ab158f8a2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若位于中间集团以后\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bf4ff6b4feac123e0dfaeded374e0ddab05ccedb2067a9531723f100c486ae3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db40e0e10b65dd086a16657",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成超越时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b32b64aad448c807f20ff87e6c17ac4bf4d788387ddad802c9788afaef2dc263",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f38911342fa6db67b4717b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘完成超越时,速度提升、\\n加速度微幅提升\\n并且稍微恢复持久力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f2ec5863c41d74bb0afc341a2cf4c7fd891e3c7c0e7e8592729ce3f4c4c53a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100103111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:decb4798466e1152ffc06a3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将自己所承载的强烈信念化为力量\\n在最终弯道上大幅提升速度\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e71e2115ecf22cf6d59ed2998795aa9b8064cd594ab1b963ac90c3b77d681ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100103211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fb7ec4bd07257143e09d28d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上从后方赶超时\\n会使用末脚少量加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "230107a6aeccc06355d46bd2993bdd0c23685f1cb2c199c16370cfb66bbc661d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bf9c58ef195e22ec22f690",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从后方绕到外道赶超时\\n在最终直线上加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "951c9653c9fe55db8035fb69a9e08da5d68620c2df928966ca3b40ff3379d20d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d35a2d34a0ae813d55fb64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于前方时\\n绝对不能被超越的觉悟使得速度提升；\\n若是在长距离比赛中仍体力充沛,变为大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "48920b65cd97eed18ba3ee24ea3660edac7ee220df7f767805ace05c6e3758cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fea480f4fb8f4fa20e37540",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上仍保有余力且处于前列时\\n更容易保持优势",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea70da9300d31994bc9b7c502a619d078ec678062580c5abf87e7c723dad26ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3743c1e7b7828d49b23cd2d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后处于前列\\n和前面或者后面的马娘距离接近时\\n王者般的光辉会使速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "88a0bde0ade27fa814ebd5fee3bdbd905e4d136ba1b6640b3b7d481281258e55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a3d21b705531cb738cb0af0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之后在外道完成赶超时\\n以怪物般的力量加快速度\\n如果还在中盘争夺过名次,变为大幅加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acc86fc9c51bc8ac2ba24fb90b6c9bf5616110f42d7203f239dd84dfb5487ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db19ff32a7ba3432196c8f49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘赶超3次后\\n最终直线上会大幅加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "91f6bc9d268242e18edd3bc04d0959cd268e464bda4da50e7e4d6667c6d0a124",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1054123b646a64ab78cf8e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道从中后方赶超时\\n犹如女帝般的奔跑会使速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "559411b7c5b648729a99929cb3c78660ad3fab53beade6fd8cfc158fcb9710bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e7c217a0b65b74acfebcdc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘2次赶超的话,就会因近距离膜拜的马娘们过于神圣\\n不假思索地加快速度\\n且路线选择变得更明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0b7b4028abff9130a99c95b117b2652301a2204d98371493cce37f56b8ec46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf07225cc7fc6db816161f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道上处于第一位时\\n想着这可真是万幸并提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0dd75ff3c4586ecdf23c778b2054948f440e0e1b612597036a901a13babaab8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70cd5b45488f3037a1bca48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时起步晚的时间减少\\n并且稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "594e0b5a0a31c2d3fb55a6416abb7a1ba87eac9a8ecc8aaf410b388e3e6c9ef6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ef28bb80a9d5aee0f8a4976",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道时若处于领先则提升加速度\\n并且稍微向前方突进＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b092d366285112ba89784870c1ca590481b56149067cb59cdaca2e03b15340d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd06416b2f051ee15f87d7fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是逆时针赛道\\n则速度和力量提升\\n若是东京赛马场的1800m比赛\\n则极大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cef5d76d04cb2ff126c7d8554f47c7636f48f454b56f0890d16ef96130444a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:593dc873ee626aa4f3725f4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa5f0958105b88abff5dea705b7df1febe9fd3c33073e98c26740f7e2ab2a0c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ec81f27047740cd4206325e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2200m的比赛临近终盘时\\n若自身位于第一名,则一段时间内\\n速度大幅提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ef664df20524c879e2f6161bb1441a11935286002c277d8537415bba8f6cc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100202121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:941fdb928859020384a86c8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出闸时加速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b7cdc887b5595b1dc338110f8d4691237e25d31f2279fd993d2f1395fe05e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f7d0e0d525c52f0286e058",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半的直线处在好位置\\n或者从集团中部瞄准前方的话\\n就会如闪电一般冲刺",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e2e71ffdbd9c2d90c9ff56ac86146d2e0b415e632e9a9582969cf114e318463",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4447f71f12278c94f6c0293e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛程后半若处于好位置并进行名次争夺\\n会因奔跑而身心雀跃\\n速度获得提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "2da73c996d96844682cc05b99430ec4b3f650ab779bfc2a6818dfd38e117153d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5719ab62ba65cdc5b0ecc9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道前身处前方时\\n速度提升。若是比赛中全程保持冷静\\n胜利的方程式会使速度变为大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4db979e1c2f57be52b96b2ae86199e58e74c4566c479e3d6e096b27ba5a540d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5af78405a0fc7a5943fb94b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n在直线上更容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "be2a4a9fd27efc4eb00f84bdd3a2e212cd95da9dbaa50f3e0ea43d36ea09d8e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf2879e02143f6916ebb187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半,从中间梯队\\n追逐『友人』而逐渐提升速度\\n使前方的马娘畏首畏尾",
      "source_fingerprint": "c75901ffcea28186d0af97cfcd46ced08dbcd96a491312e9bb4c9666b9d77ccf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f105d77c8027f574f6b4d8d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有起步晚的情况下\\n在最终直线身处前方时速度提升\\n若是一直保持在靠前位置的话\\n变为速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c39cec4faec6634de1170e965c107c12067f34436e86e2bb5e8fbc1736086b8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd2df887635ec8aa31e68da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中想要冲向前列时\\n提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "7020a63ff37e8a00ba918e07017c6fd8eea90784ca102e9e3f45761c3d08a717",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d072721bb3cb7936ebc2145b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛的中段处于好位置准备超越时\\n速度少量提升\\n若是短距离比赛则效果改为\\n小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e491894e299403a63c9af500ecb1a9d3340a6a6b7589e7f5a9537b54736083c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6077fc8eaba1b826bd2c292",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后300米处在前方\\n且与最前方的马娘距离很近或是领头时\\n速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af06b7f998a09bbd0126393d30443b406d00ab68eae7bca882d39a3e3fe146d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e50db8dafecc20f8bed25063",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘完成超越并身处前方时\\n最终直线上会爆发出强烈的意志\\n使得速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "207dab470a722b28df5e1d672796fda34b1ec2a19eb17cede99b4b89eaef7542",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135bb7911e65bbff94d6638a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "左右移动时加速度提升\\n并且小幅提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "618841073921b707ac5ad9e9f6272f444e69a03f893283481d7df25bef2d580b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd3f886183374860c20023a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,一段时间内路线选择\\n变得更明智\\n并且速度与加速度小幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf0ac0a0f818f43ac82a68905e933fd93f4661099e79f06a87b6409095d6ac68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c129cd67bfdca2b9b74032",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘开始时\\n若位于前方则提升加速度\\n此外，若是东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则向前突进＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d947a9b1d465443ac375a0fc2fb1062e13cc5fb8184cb9358183a262bbee335a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bdbbfe01e7aa9007f58bc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘身处前方时\\n回复持久力,并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a01ef98e50787be1e9ec371b3ec4723ced444df829236db71d8caca1898a5dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8abceb92abd33011bc14983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "左右移动时回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e8b765b529e296b3c7e1e8696209827e2f8d1d47fad1e0987f4d288d714bd5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a318337a2c5a8a52b47d30d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于前方时提高加速度\\n若在2400m～2500m的比赛中耐力数值十分高\\n则在终盘初段更早时间内大幅提升加速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa4b571f0afe7f6d4a7bf3c1ce44f04fcdec3e9f6920945dede80bb6861f8b00",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100303111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:308c1267e26d56a4e4fda35a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若位于前方\\n则回复少量体力并提升少量速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ed94e83230802bb7a55d29d88776a1dec6cb229f35a769f724c647678ffc5e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100303211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce5102ad7efb309a98b86f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于前方时\\n稍微消耗体力使速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c690d671aae0a8767b98953e490fc87723885da2bf0244bd4cef636bfbd67e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100303221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2e18d7f988d205c1f53fb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m左右处于前方的话提高速度\\n若刚好上完坡\\n则速度大幅提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2dda1b4551432eadb3cc1c01461f186af6bbf8132f82cf5b8fb7d7bd01c88e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95bf5a9ee61282d832143a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半且靠近弯道时\\n持久力恢复\\n且短时间内稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "11ac82462a200d2dc59571f770829f334b6d4b7024c376705e135a31b57d65d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5b58bcfe1aba0d089a942b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线被前方拉开距离时\\n会如同得到星之引导一般加快速度\\n此时若靠近最后方的话速度会大幅上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1335c1dbcd8113ea0e6469f52a662fa61899e98bc7596f6075ba9040fedb7c32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a63a51302f9759408f8d8320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半,一直位于队伍中后方等待时机的话\\n在名次争夺时,将展现出江户之子的潜力\\n速度大幅上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a541c516651bec90ccb8795f155f2eb41cbe10682a6d121f580fae10390966",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5deb0e37b79e0524073b5a67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后进行名次争夺,在最终直线位于前方时\\n涌现出不服输的强烈求胜心,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d62348f838c39ffb479265bdf8a754e1644bd4ee99f20b1a5ab8bb0f422c763",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a858b37ced277b1ad1c1e501",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后若处于队伍中部靠近内埒一侧\\n则会找到通往胜利的道路,在最终直线\\n提高速度,容易找到好路线",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad90af65c0dcce335baa2470b9f62bac0f84e82f4ff172c9a868901c3138fdb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11808d53d950c1bbc4473056",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是冷静地进行比赛,并在最终直线上位于\\n第三名以后的话,速度提升。若是持续\\n身处中团的话,变为大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "729ad7fba47cec0dc896b9166b17c5968e5d9f01058c53554c15c6e06768ead4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94fafa4f7e9a1c01ea7006b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘附近处于好位置时\\n赶超的话就会充满气势的开始前进",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6e1e7b85c168a604b20059d402600bdfd420e43ce345ec1ad922346bd5b83e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45835f6892826f9c695321f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线进行名次争夺时\\n可爱地飞奔提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4d83e35df040e3199df13ceb480c1b769bcd3a043866d29bb9871e40a7311e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a8b89d9e1b69845d964e4dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于中间集团并开始发力时\\n充分发挥实力\\n速度逐渐少量提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69b8406530ae18323c919b10344286e5311a5f8a53332ef3473c2b69d0250fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41ea6f0534048ec02e3bcd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f925b4c9f309147e6bd9b7901d3f48a8d63465b88b5235af652396a47f89b604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ccdd2c01b9dab562aefa941",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半领先时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "615842181811577381dd16baef5b3f4f7c977cbf311a0864936680610e5416f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae8a57d1a4628dbb8bb326f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘被追近时\\n会在一段时间内向前冲出＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "861d3fa7b6737ffa9d2120df523f2ce25b8a1091fc7de0e320b26f26d7f7aa6c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3278384aad428ce3e617326",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处上坡时,大量回复持久力\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2a4e7049636557bbd9eabef98be4f4dc529de6cd167ab31c39bec1e3def8eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac1c089255cb41eca8afae4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在上坡略微回复持久力\n并向前突进<领放·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "104d7f2ad664dcd3e8edd9a8b8220d01c42045d27fc569745f95c2ce1ee90223",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100402121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0f648723b74126babd8646",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若位于前方\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b411601a49d2564078748dd1bb6fbb40b2ec74b792b490ff9b78243e8ecd2596",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a25cd12b4b7e71d5a6ee8fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "准备超越或者被逼近时\\n大幅向前突进＜领放・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f9449d6751a460947f9b5ee4c64fc5155b6db95d6722beadf64c4299b607d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100403111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91b2ce4eda23efcbf085280c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段被逼近时\\n大幅向前突进＜领放・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "86fef1a0203baa83faa636ad0fd145baf1df491068ed1ee5d36afa8df765e39f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100403211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340ee4ee62db238e6e7a5c83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n发挥爆进之力,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca029c93cf0b16a5d21764c4ad0dadc7a969dd72f0d4dcaea09c2b7f1fd3567",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fb305fcf4130aa3188282fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余200m处自身不在领头位置\\n距离领头4马身以内时速度提升\\n距离2马身以内时速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8985caffefd8a8cd0d77ba40de4c77a10c27ee0cb085cc292c86f19d406ba293",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f39bcb86fbe6ed04d7f3c5f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "名次争夺时,速度稍稍上升\\n若是身处沙土比赛,则会以要噬咬前方选手般\\n的气势进一步提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b6c85fc42f400d28e1a5467b535266a193e2ad87dfde07616460405a647517",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92248df88779e21cddbc6d73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入最终弯道前能一直保持冷静\\n在后方等待机会的话,会在距离终点剩余300m处\\n发动加速魔法,速度持续上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0e033dfe05fc045e02fac69362278a87d990ca1186f33faea6663f74d368f42",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b53aab8de5f20908bad54c82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于好位置时\\n持久力回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e840da6f513589eb3f91d109657894e66fbd62c08de278830ffa1e9337503bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4d36524d12aefc221eb1c23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线位于前方\\n并被后面的马娘拉近距离时\\n绝不让步的想法将会化作动力",
      "source_fingerprint": "73db05e4deb762d6e62794bed18ffd1bb0ef9f95c9cf6140539c1fd9584d5bcf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:629da9be1f97acb4b30ca969",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘阶段剩余400m处位于前方时\\n速度提升,且在GⅠ比赛\\n等大舞台上取得高人气时,速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d822f9128917a15f5176ee4a821434bb99bcab3d1279b60e7dba285f24d02ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc5218f532d74ac954a2a59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线上身处前方\\n完成超越或是即将被超越时\\n速度会随兴致一起提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e5c4e82cdbf9ccfc84c9997d6194496fa9b6ca2813feca9f69cc2941412dc1f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651bb573efeddff6f402abb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后准备超越前方马娘时\\n将在剩余400m以后的好位置处提高速度\\n人气较低的时候速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "949bf7491215935fd69cc3634d60805c0f38608ab9ad1202d24c4c344b1052bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100491"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4363d50c8f71c74c626084b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从中间梯队向前突进时\\n以凌厉的攻势加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "87b14b983e23bfda1e79a0f6547c66a34c4d7a5af1324643ff7f4d3aa28c04a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d095441986533356d2e137aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行赶超时,速度大幅提升\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c119a06f54ae59b50e843cc5ea7e649ca396e31e3556322dd07524f2b68598",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0976282c7c3c875e5ffd11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n回复持久力,并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6d2825a71c02b64dc3c2e5b575a1babd066fb8e64a633c5c1e1da57b1b2ee7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3518acdd36b927d08f35f91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n稍微恢复耐力并提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7e643bdf92660bbe3eac20bbad3d11569bcd9b2a695159ba33f1389820d272",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:771e7ca38dfaa596c91cd55f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n剥夺身后焦躁的赛马娘的持久力\\n提升自己的速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "199c0d9f08c694f746f282385df0721a5af437dc947933c84363800652c4a5e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20155a7286dba49b68c55c5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道处速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f53460263245cec9620e8dad1058318f7755d9de9102b26bd73200123c4201c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100502121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a021884a314806cd71b20e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d8211d02851abab35bd903734e4d87204c6e814fe0fa9c70bc14df1711ed0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:412f11eb527d73fcbacd03aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入比赛后半段时极大幅度向前突进\n在中山赛场且耐力充足时\n随后的全速冲刺阶段将稍微提升冲刺性能\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb8e48635fc933388bc12346969beb5e25336115186758af2d8cb70210a19fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100503111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076d783a3568ec486173bd4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘以后的最终弯道或中山赛场的终盘以后弯道上\n处于中间集团及以前时加速度提升\n随后在最终直线上速度稍微提升\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ad6d891df94d8ab1ce06e92cbbd50178ba508e1205217a074971f2c1fff937",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100503211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1141795528b04e6367b30b62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘经过弯道竞争\\n且终盘的最终弯道过半后自身占据好位置时\\n提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "079aa7ce4ff38cba75369c588fc61a44be69bf733d268b11307aceb76ce157fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56983285d245638a3251fe0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于靠后位置时\\n会看着附近的赛马娘并恢复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "e471b891cacb2cbbcfe4543d6365658e0c3f76fbd05132f0a15e3e1bf506e293",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380f367f2c419e7500e6ef7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘处于最终弯道且身处后方向前逼近时\\n短时间内加速度提升,每次超越其他马娘\\n都会增强效果并刷新时间,最多增强三次",
      "source_fingerprint": "c33faab4c2622ad170e37451e419a01343f84245702724402084a22c4a231e43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541cf4f4581b1bd00ade93ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段若从后方进行了超越\\n剩余150m后自身位于前方时\\n在短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbafea735c34900460837dec2417db383092f18613376b228f6fc232ad0cdba5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100541"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
